sequenceDiagram
  participant G as Gateway
  participant O as Order
  participant R as RabbitMQ
  participant N as Notification
  G->>O: REST correlationId
  O->>R: OrderConfirmed.v1 correlationId eventId
  R->>N: at-least-once delivery
  N->>N: inbox(eventId)
  Note over G,N: JSON logs and metrics joined by correlationId
